      "name": "D-Link DIR-505: Stack-based buffer overflow in TFTP Upload Filename Handler (CVE-2026-120189)",
      "description": "A vulnerability was identified in D-Link DIR-505 1.10B02. The affected functions are `save_upload_file`/`mp_upload_file` located in `/usr/bin/tftpd`, part of the TFTP Upload Filename Handler component. This manipulation leads to a stack-based buffer overflow. The attack can be carried out remotely. Publicly available exploit code exists.\n",
      "published": "2026-11-01T02:07:23.000Z",
