      "name": "Presenton: API authentication vulnerability (CVE-2026-120191)",
      "description": "A weakness has been identified in Presenton versions up to 0.9.11-beta affecting unknown functionality of the component API. This issue results in missing authentication and can be initiated remotely. A public exploit is available. Upgrading to version 0.9.12-beta (patch 44c8a61122b21f17642d717b0c4d6f2c54c0f180) is recommended to resolve this issue.\n",
